{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2022-10-21 17:10:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN COPPER INDUSTRY VETERAN TAYLOR MELVIN TO JOIN IVANHOE ELECTRIC AS ITS PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': 'WILL LEAD THE COMPANY AS IT DEVELOPS THE CRITICAL MINERAL MINES NECESSARY FOR THE ENERGY TRANSITION IN THE UNITED STATES ROBERT FRIEDLAND WILL CONTINUE AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN ERIC FINLAYSON WILL ASSUME NEW ROLE AS CHIEF OF GLOBAL EXPLORATION NEW YORK, NY / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 21, 2022 / IVANHOE ELECTRIC (NYSE AMERICAN:IE)(TSX:IE) CHAIRMAN AND CURRENT CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER ROBERT FRIEDLAND AND CURRENT PRESIDENT ERIC FINLAYSON ARE PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT TAYLOR MELVIN WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS ITS PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. MR. MELVIN HAS OVER 20 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE IN THE NATURAL RESOURCES SECTOR AS A SENIOR CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT PROFESSIONAL AND INVESTMENT BANKER.'}